                  </div>
                  <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                    <strong>Termite swarmers</strong> possess straight beaded antennae, uniform thick waists with no constriction, and two pairs of wings of equal length.
                  </p>
                  <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>Flying ants</strong> have elbowed antennae, distinctly pinched (wasp-like) waists, and forewings noticeably larger than their hindwings.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08] flex flex-col justify-between">
