                  </div>
                  <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed mb-3">
                    <strong>House mice</strong> have small heads, proportionally large ears, pointed snouts, and slender tails longer than their body length.
                  </p>
                  <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
                    <strong>Young roof rats</strong> have large, chunky hind feet out of proportion to their bodies, blunt heads, and scaly heavy tails.
                  </p>
