            <p class="text-zinc-300 text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-4xl">
              More than 70% of persistent urban pest infestations originate from unsealed exterior gaps and interior moisture leaks. Implement these practical prevention measures for long-term protection.
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 text-xs text-zinc-300">
              <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.05]">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#E5A93C]"></span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-white text-sm">1. Kitchen Sanitation &amp; Food Storage</span>
                </div>
                <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-zinc-400 pl-4 list-disc">
                  <li>Wipe down grease behind kitchen cooktops and stoves nightly with warm soapy water.</li>
                  <li>Store pantry pulses, grains, and sugars inside airtight glass or thick plastic jars.</li>
                  <li>Dispose of wet organic kitchen waste in tightly lidded bins before retiring for the night.</li>
                  <li>Never leave open pet food in bowls overnight on kitchen or utility room floors.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.05]">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-white text-sm">2. Moisture Control &amp; Plumbing Defense</span>
                </div>
                <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-zinc-400 pl-4 list-disc">
                  <li>Repair weeping under-sink valves and drain traps to deprive roaches of water.</li>
                  <li>Ensure all bathroom and balcony floor drains feature intact cockroach-proof jali traps.</li>
                  <li>Route air-conditioner condensation drainage pipes safely away from outer wall bases.</li>
                  <li>Fix persistent wall seepage to prevent subterranean termites and fungal spores.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.05]">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-purple-400"></span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-white text-sm">3. Physical Exclusion &amp; Structural Sealing</span>
                </div>
                <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-zinc-400 pl-4 list-disc">
                  <li>Install heavy-duty rubber brush sweeps on all exterior main and kitchen balcony doors.</li>
                  <li>Seal pipe voids around gas lines, dishwashers, and sinks with copper mesh and silicone.</li>
                  <li>Install 20-mesh stainless steel fly and mosquito screens on openable windows.</li>
                  <li>Seal cracks along granite skirting boards and modular cabinet joints with clear caulk.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div class="p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.05]">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
                  <span class="font-bold text-white text-sm">4. Travel &amp; Package Hygiene</span>
                </div>
                <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-zinc-400 pl-4 list-disc">
                  <li>Place hotel luggage on elevated racks or bathtubs, never directly on hotel beds or carpets.</li>
                  <li>Unpack suitcases in laundry areas and wash travel garments immediately at high temperatures.</li>
                  <li>Inspect corrugated cardboard grocery delivery boxes outside before bringing them indoors.</li>
                  <li>Thoroughly examine second-hand furniture and mattress seams before moving them into your home.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
